cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PyWKSpectra in your research, please cite this software
  and its author. Sharing your resulting publication is also appreciated.
type: software
title: 'PyWKSpectra: Wheeler–Kiladis Space–Time Spectral Analysis in Python'
authors:
  - family-names: Jaramillo Moreno
    given-names: Alejandro
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4175-7726'
    affiliation: >-
      Departamento de Cambio Climático,
      Instituto de Ciencias de la Atmósfera y Cambio Climático,
      Universidad Nacional Autónoma de México (UNAM)
abstract: >-
  PyWKSpectra is a Python package under development for the calculation,
  analysis, and visualization of Wheeler–Kiladis space–time spectra
  of tropical atmospheric variability.
keywords:
  - Wheeler–Kiladis
  - space–time spectra
  - equatorial waves
  - tropical atmosphere
  - Python
